{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>I have covered you.</b> To deliver you, for he said 'to destroy' as its appointed purpose [above 13]." "<b>To plant heavens.</b> By way of parable, that he prophesies concerning the lands that they shall return to their former state." "<b>And to found.</b> A verb name, and the yod is concealed as is its rule, and behold it comes like the complete [form], and like it מניח לו לישון (Ecclesiastes 5:1)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 51, :notes {0 "The citation 'above 13' likely refers to Isaiah 13, where בשומי להשחיתם appears in a similar construction."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:59:03.483054587Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}